## So sánh Kiến trúc: Hiện tại vs Đề xuất

```
HIỆN TẠI (Single-pass, no challenge):
User → Brainstorm SKILL.md → ThinkRunner (1 pass) → LLM viết VEMRA → Output
                                                       ↑ no challenge
                                                       ↑ no persona
                                                       ↑ no retrieval

ĐỀ XUẤT (Multi-agent, adversarial, compound):
User → Brainstorm Orchestrator
       ├── ThinkRunner (iterative, 2-3 passes)
       │   ├── DuckDuckGo pass
       │   ├── Ladder runner (non-Google sources)
       │   └── Surprise-driven deep dive
       ├── CompoundCache (reads brainstorm_claims + decision_vectors)
       ├── Agent 1: Analyst (VEMRA draft)
       ├── Agent 2: 3 Persona agents (parallel, independent thinking)
       ├── Agent 3: Bullshit-detector (challenge every claim)
       ├── Synthesizer (merge + resolve disagreements)
       ├── Gate Validator (Python, code-enforced)
       └── Quality Scorer (compare with previous runs)
```

